---
description: Angular UI components must use separate html/scss/ts files
globs: src/frontend/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# Angular component files

Do not put HTML or CSS inline in `.ts` files.

- Use `templateUrl: './name.component.html'`
- Use `styleUrls: ['./name.component.scss']`
- Never use `template:` or `styles:` for UI components (including tiny `router-outlet` roots)

Exception: none for product UI. Specs and generated docs are not components.
